# Base CyberPrompts. Fields: title, use, prompt, tip, model. Defensive and authorised use only.
M_GEN = "Any capable general chat model works. Pick one with a long context window when you paste large inputs."
M_LONG = "Use a model with a long context window so the full log or report fits in one go. Never paste secrets or client data into a tool your organisation has not approved."
M_REASON = "A model with strong step-by-step reasoning helps here. Check every claim it makes against the source."
M_CODE = "A code-focused model or a general model with strong coding skills. Keep code you are not allowed to share out of public tools."
M_WRITE = "Any strong writing model. Ask it to keep your tone and to flag claims it cannot support."

